flowchart LR
    A[Live predictions + inputs] --> B[Log features, outputs, latency]
    B --> C[Operational: latency, errors, cost]
    B --> D[Data drift: input distribution shift]
    B --> E[Concept drift: label relationship shift]
    B --> F[Quality: accuracy when labels arrive]
    C --> G{Threshold breached?}
    D --> G
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G -- Yes --> H[Alert on-call]
    H --> I[Investigate root cause]
    I --> J{Action}
    J -- Retrain --> K[Trigger pipeline]
    J -- Rollback --> L[Previous model version]
    G -- No --> A
